error BYN0001: bidirectional control character U+202E is not allowed outside string literals

  1 │ '�' $"{n"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{$"{x}"}"}"}"}"}"
